        "original_id": "136253da-99c1-5bf7-a602-0eedff76ea19",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: SLS station, Sahara station, Circus Circus Las Vegas, Las Vegas Strip, Winchester, Nevada\n- Systems: Las Vegas Monorail\n- Projects: possible downtown extension of the monorail\n- Topics: station track design, hotel and casino property\n\nFacts:\n- The tracks just north of Sahara station were designed to provide access to a possible downtown extension of the Las Vegas Monorail.\n- The possible downtown extension of the Las Vegas Monorail would have run via the northern portion of the Las Vegas Strip near Circus Circus Las Vegas and the Riviera.\n- Circus Circus Las Vegas is a hotel, a 123,928 square foot casino, and an RV park.\n- Circus Circus Las Vegas is located on the Las Vegas Strip in Winchester, Nevada.",
